NAME
    top - refresh current application process accounting

SYNOPSIS
    top [COUNT]

DESCRIPTION
    Refreshes the bounded process snapshot once per second. COUNT limits the
    number of snapshots; without it, top runs until Ctrl-C. CPU time includes
    only charged unprivileged execution and excludes kernel service work.
    PREEMPTS and YIELDS accumulate over the process lifetime, so their growth
    between snapshots is the recent rate of scheduler entry.
